modifier.anticorrosion.desc=§oFor the times when you splash the chemical§r\nEvery tick, there is a small chance that the holder's poison is healed (when held in hand).
modifier.aoa_threshold.desc=§oYou thought you could get away with an overpowered tool, did you?§r\nThis tool requires %s Level %d.
modifier.apocalypse.desc=§oThe end times...§r\nYour victim becomes moribund and is afflicted with increasing levels of Wither.
modifier.autorepair.desc=§oHandy!§r\nWhen the tool breaks, a sharpening kit is grabbed from your inventory to repair it. If the tool is unbreakable, gain 1 modifier instead.
modifier.barrett.desc=§oBam!§r\nAs health decreases, there is an increasing chance of a critical hit.
modifier.blindbandit.desc=§oPulling a ... someone.§r\nA mob called the "Blind Bandit" will sometimes be summoned for a limited time after you attack or are attacked. She will attack hostile mobs, and will also attack those who dare attack her (except you), piercing armor on mobs.
modifier.bloodymary.desc=§oBrought to you by the legendary Queen of England...§r\nDeals bonus damage depending on the amount of health already lost by the target. Also, a chance to drop a Coagulated Blood for each hit.
modifier.botanical.desc=§oI eat zombies for breakfast§r\nIncreases the amount of modifier slots; the effect stacks greatly.
modifier.brownmagic.desc=§oYou're weird.§r\nPress the "set portal" key (default "N") to set a virtual portal on the block you are pointing at. By default, press "Y" to teleport there (if there is enough space).
modifier.camdaibay_armor.desc=§oNo, it's not some bay in Vietnam!§r\nIf the player is attacked and is blocking, inflicts the player's negative status effects on the attacker.
modifier.chadthunder.desc=§oThe virgin killing by weapon alone vs the CHAD killing by thunder strikes§r\nEnemies struck by this weapon have thunderbolts rained down on them.
modifier.darktraveler.desc=§oAll hail...the King of Chaos!§r\nSurrounding mobs get randomly afflicted with damage.
modifier.devilsstrength.desc=§oRivaling Satan...§r\nBonus damage to non-Overworld mobs.
modifier.devilsstrength.extra=Vs Non-Overworld: +%s
modifier.divineshield.desc=§oOf the guardians, by the guardians, and for the guardians§r\nWhile this tool is in your hand, you are granted fire resistance. Also, damage is reduced, but at a durability cost.
modifier.dprk.desc=§oWhen your missiles explode right after launch§r\nWhen attacking or defending, Supreme Leaders will spawn, exploding on opponents in the same manner as a creeper.
modifier.dunanstransport_armor.desc=§oThe FedEx of one square foot of land§r\nBonus armor protection and toughness for riding players.
modifier.elemental.desc=§oElemental...§r\nWhen gravity-affected blocks are destroyed, break all blocks of the same type above and below. Also, a chance to gain various benefits from a sucessful attack.
modifier.explosive.desc=§oKa-boom!§r\nAn explosion is created on each hit.
modifier.fruitsalad.desc=§oYummy yummy§r\nA tool with this trait can store up to 5 types of fruits.
modifier.getlucky.desc=§oLike the legend of the phoenix...§r\nPress the "set portal" key (default "N") to set a virtual portal on the block you are pointing at. If you are on the brink of death, you have %d phoenixite gems to spare, and the portal has enough space above, then the gems are consumed, you are teleported to the virtual portal, and you are spared. (The tool must be in your hand.)
modifier.ghastly.desc=§oOh, the horror!§r\nIf the holder is attacked while sneaking, the attacker is inflicted with Slowness.
modifier.global.desc=§oAround the world... and back§r\nShift-right-click a block in order for items from broken blocks and killed entities to get transported in there if it is an inventory.
modifier.goodfridayagreement_armor.desc=§oTroubles over?§r\nIron golems will not attack a player having this trait.
modifier.hailhydra.desc=§oHeads§r\nRandom explosions plague your enemies. Also, when you are attacked, there is a chance to get Absorption.
modifier.haorans_cult_armor.desc=§oHarry, harry on the wall, who's the hairiest of them all?§r\nWhen withered, reduces HP of all mobs in a certain range by 30% every second.
modifier.hearts.desc=§oHey, what's with that plus sign on that guy's mod?§r\nThe higher your health, the more damage you do.
modifier.heavy_metal.desc=§oHeave-ho!§r\nIncreased knockback + Slowness on target.
modifier.ignoble.desc=§oTo a new low§r\nAs one takes damage, one starts to harbor feelings of ignoble jealousy as the offender is killed. When this trait is enabled, those feelings are vented when attacking while sneaking.
modifier.illuminati.desc=§oConfirmed!§r\nWhile the tool is in your hand, nearby entities (that do not hold a tool with this trait) glow, and you become invisible.
modifier.im_a_superstar.desc=§oI am a superstar!…[falls into the toilet]§r\nEffects depend on the player's attunement.
modifier.invariant_armor.desc=§oThe more things change, the more they stay the same.§r\nStops terrain (not entity) damage from nearby explosions.
modifier.jaded.desc=§oCat§r\nMobs attacked with this tool have their ability to heal temporarily hindered.
modifier.jetpackpancakehippos.desc=§oTOUCHDOWN!§r\nGrants the user the ability to fly using energy. (Same stats as the jetpack used.) Also grants a bonus to durability.
modifier.light.desc=§oLow-weight§r\nAttack and mining speed increases.
modifier.mana.desc=§oRechargeable... with flowers§r\nMana can be used in place of durability, and can heal the tool over time.
modifier.mirabile.desc=§oWonderful to see§r\nOccasionally, a gold or diamond ore will appear in stone immediately surrounding you (at the cost of durability).
modifier.morganlefay.desc=§oLancelot...§r\nBonus magic damage (ranging from 0.0 to 5.0; Gaussian distributed) is afflicted (it is absolute).
modifier.musicofthespheres.desc=§o"The earth is flat!" said Steve§r\nThe tool doubles as a movable boombox.
modifier.mystical_fire.desc=§oA hidden secret lies within...§r\nSets the target on fire, and damages the target with magic for a certain amount of time.
modifier.naphtha.desc=§oChildren of the Sun§r\nArrows (and bolts) burn the target on impact.
modifier.naturesblessing.desc=§oWonderful...§r\nA chance to drop bread per mob killed or block broken. Sometimes heals the player by a bit after killing a mob.
modifier.naturespower.desc=§oFeel the power...§r\nAfter attacking a mob: 20% chance to burn target. 20% chance to give player Speed. 20% chance to give player Strength.
modifier.natureswrath.desc=§oNature's wrath burning...§r\nAfter attacking a mob, there is a chance to burn the target, as well as to heal the player.
modifier.nickoftime.desc=§oPhew!§r\nPress the "set portal" key (default "N") to set a virtual portal on the block you are pointing at (shift for armor; do not shift for tools). If you are on the brink of death, you have %d ender pearls to spare, and the portal has enough space above, then the pearls are consumed, you are teleported to the virtual portal, and you are spared. (The tool must be in your hand.)
modifier.portly.desc=§oTesting nuclear bombs off the Korean coast, oh yeah!§r\nShift-right-click an entity to capture it (costs durability based on entity health). Press the "release entity" key (default "0") in order to release it.
modifier.psicological.desc=§o...the reverse kind§r\nTools heal with Psi.
modifier.rudeawakening.desc=§oThe hydra grovels before me...§r\nDamage pierces armor (mobs only).
modifier.sassy.desc=§oThe sass...§r\nCrit on players and bosses.
modifier.slashing.desc=§oA critical hit!§r\nCritical hits gain 20% more damage!
modifier.soulcharge.desc=§oThe soul is charged on a googolplex counts§r\nAdds Soul Power per block mined: +5, +2, and +1 for pickaxe, axe, and shovel-minable blocks respectively.
modifier.soulpower.desc=§oI hereby declare defendant guilty on all charges§r\nAttack damage increases based on the amount of Soul Power you have, but attacks use it up.
modifier.spades.desc=§oTrump suit: Make Tinkers Great Again!§r\nThe lower your health, the more damage you do.
modifier.starfishy.desc=§o2+2=5§r\nPress the "set portal" key (default "N") to set a virtual portal on the block you are pointing at. If you are on the brink of death, you have %d enori crystals to spare, and the portal has enough space above, then the crystals are consumed, you are teleported to the virtual portal, and you are spared. (The tool must be in your hand.)
modifier.stopbeingselfish.desc=§oBrayden stop being selfish!§r\nMore damage is added the closer other players are to the attacker.
modifier.terrafirma.desc=§oSolid earth§r\nWhile this tool is in your hand (or this armor is worn), you will heal over time.
modifier.thaumic.desc=§oYou're back.§r\nA tool with this modifier gains 1 extra modifier slot, or 2 extra slots if either at least 3 parts have this trait, or the tool is made entirely out of parts with this trait.
modifier.thundering.desc=§oRise, Thor!§r\nSummon a thunderbolt on impact.
modifier.tom_and_jerry_armor.desc=§o[laughs in flattening Tom]§r\nExplosions caused by a user with this trait slow down those affected.
modifier.trash.desc=§oTraaaaaassshhh!§r\nRandom stuff is slowly generated when the tool is selected, but the tool is damaged slowly in this way.
modifier.unnamed.desc=§oIt's you-know-who...§r\nBonus damage accrued for each entity of the same type as the target close to it.
modifier.vindictive.desc=§oYou are not forgiven!§r\nBonus damage to players, and you gain some health by attacking.
